# 💼 Reshma Lakshmanan – Personal Portfolio

This is my personal portfolio website built with **React.js**. It showcases my skills, projects, experience, and contact information in a modern and responsive layout.

## 🚀 Features

- Responsive design for all screen sizes
- Projects section with live previews and source code
- Skills and tools categorized clearly
- About me section with my background
- Contact form integration
- Clean and minimal UI

## 🛠️ Built With

- React.js
- Tailwind CSS
- JavaScript (ES6+)
- HTML5 & CSS3
- Git & GitHub
 
